WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:34.360
Sólo por un momento, ¿vale?

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.360
So...

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.200
What is going on

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.000
between you and

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.560
the walking temptation, huh?

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.000
You won’t believe what happened

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.920
in the office tonight.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:52.000
It got so intense.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.800
At first,

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:53.960
he grabbed me.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:54.880
No.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.000
Kissed me.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.200
Oh, excuse me.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.080
And other stuff.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.920
He couldn't stop himself.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:03.440
Wow.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:04.640
Charlotte,

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.760
this is so wild.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.880
Congrats.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.640
You're in deep.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.120
Any girl would do anything

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.960
to be in your position.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:19.800
Next thing I know, he's just

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.160
cold as ice.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.120
You’re overthinking it, girl.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.160
Just go with the flow!
